<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA 294-5 V GUYANA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 294-5 V GUYANA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 294-5 at the close on the opening day of their four-day match against Guyana on Friday.</p>
